msgid "Built-in display brightness prefers the system backlight service (CSD Screen D-Bus, no extra package needed), falling back to brightnessctl. External monitors need ddcutil. If none is available, the brightness slider is hidden automatically.\n\nsudo apt install brightnessctl ddcutil\n\nNOTE: ddcutil needs i2c access. After installing, run: sudo usermod -aG i2c $USER\nand log out and back in."
msgstr "内屏亮度优先使用系统背光服务（CSD Screen D-Bus，无需额外安装），失败回退到 brightnessctl；外接显示器需要 ddcutil。三者都不可用时亮度滑块会自动隐藏。\n\nsudo apt install brightnessctl ddcutil\n\n注意：ddcutil 需要 i2c 访问权限，安装后执行：sudo usermod -aG i2c $USER\n然后注销重进。"

msgid "The Printer Settings context menu item opens system-config-printer.\n\nsudo apt install system-config-printer"
msgstr "右键菜单的打印机设置项会打开 system-config-printer。\n\nsudo apt install system-config-printer"

msgid "Network (nmcli/NM D-Bus), Bluetooth (bluetoothctl/BlueZ D-Bus), Power Mode (powerprofilesctl), battery (UPower D-Bus) and the default screenshot command (gnome-screenshot) are preinstalled on Linux Mint. Status updates are event-driven via system D-Bus signals. If a toggle appears disabled, install the missing tool:\n\nsudo apt install network-manager bluez rfkill power-profiles-daemon gnome-screenshot"
msgstr "网络（nmcli/NM D-Bus）、蓝牙（bluetoothctl/BlueZ D-Bus）、性能模式（powerprofilesctl）、电池（UPower D-Bus）和默认截图命令（gnome-screenshot）在 Linux Mint 上预装，状态更新走系统 D-Bus 信号事件驱动。如果某个开关显示为禁用，安装缺失的工具：\n\nsudo apt install network-manager bluez rfkill power-profiles-daemon gnome-screenshot"

msgid "Off by default (most machines have no WWAN hardware)"
msgstr "默认关闭（多数机器没有 WWAN 硬件）"
